 `.github/`, `*.tf`, secrets/sops, auth, firewall, network or SSH config. If a later push breaks the rule, the agent removes the label and asks for a review.\n- Removes the outdated note that the free plan doesn't review repos with fewer than 10 stars. Every recent PR got a review or a \"Review rate limited\" result without any `@coderabbitai review` comment (checked skills#152–157, nix-config#815/818, nix-presets#237–242).\n\nGoes with the cr-skip label (kleinbem/github-config) and its exclusion in kleinbem/coderabbit.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated CodeRabbit guidance to clarify that the free plan reviews pull requests but may be rate-limited.\n  * Added details on when the `cr-skip` label can be used, which files and configuration areas are excluded, and what to do if a later push breaks the rule.\n  * Clarified when to request a review manually.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-15T01:30:04Z","updated_at":"2026-11-15T02:01:34Z","closed_at":"2026-11-15T02:01:33Z","merged_at":"2026-11-15T02:01:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"f0e4f28d312a003ba427060c10055b036df0e238","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"kleinbem:cr-skip","ref":"cr-skip","repo":{"id":1407847996,"node_id":"R_kgDOU-oOPA","name":"skills","full_name":"kleinbem/skills","owner":{"login":"kleinbem","id":1173376,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzMzNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1173376?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleinbem","html_url":"https://github.com/kleinbem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleinbem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleinbem